# 📊 Firearm Background Checks Data Analysis

> Final project for the Data Science Programming course at the Universitat Oberta de Catalunya (UOC). :contentReference[oaicite:0]{index=0}

## 🚀 Overview

This project analyzes the **FBI National Instant Criminal Background Check System (NICS)** dataset to explore firearm background checks across the United States.

The project demonstrates the complete data analysis workflow:

- 📥 Data collection
- 🧹 Data cleaning
- 📊 Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
- 📈 Data visualization
- 🗺️ Interactive maps
- ✅ Unit testing

---

## ✨ Features

- Read datasets directly from external sources
- Clean and transform data using Pandas
- Aggregate statistics by state and year
- Visualize trends with Matplotlib
- Build interactive choropleth maps using Folium
- Automated unit tests with high code coverage

