## ▶️ Running the Project

Install dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

Run

```bash
python main.py
```

Run all tests

```bash
python -m unittest discover Tests
```

Generate coverage report

```bash
coverage run -m unittest discover Tests
coverage html
```

